oughout history and across genres and disciplines. Readers trust the series to provide authoritative texts enhanced by introductions and notes by distinguished scholars and contemporary authors, as well as up-to-date translations by award-winning translators.\n\nCategories: Fiction	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Ybx5UZMDVCY/hqdefault.jpg	2025-05-02 23:51:19.462756+00	215
