tes in me and without hesitation I bite his lower lip, hard. He lets out a whimper of pain and walks away from me. His hand goes to his lip... he bleeds. He gently touches the injured part and grimaces in pain. He smiles at me even as the blood paints his lips. Everyone is stunned." This Standalone Dark Mafia Romance is guaranteed to leave your kindle steaming. All books from the series are connected with each other but can be read as Standalones	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_yddadUXoQs/hqdefault.jpg	2025-05-04 00:40:14.668805+00	708
