oble's Fragile Designs is gripping suspense with closed-door romance and includes an intriguing mystery surrounding an extremely valuable Fabergé egg, second-chance romance, home renovation, and found family. Looking for more from this author? Try her Annie Pederson Series (Edge of Dusk, Dark of Night, and Break of Day) or her most recent novel coauthored with Rick Acker, I Think I Was Murdered.\n\nCategories: Fiction	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qJ6gp_Nk20c/hqdefault.jpg	2025-05-04 15:25:32.886222+00	928
