ptain Hughes by wire to assume charge of the prisoner and to deliver him into the hands of the New York officer to be conveyed to New York.\n\nCategories: Fiction	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/sB3Q4hPtOJ8/hqdefault.jpg	2025-05-06 03:36:52.699676+00	1728
