ble addition to their libraries. Beyond its entertainment value, this anthology serves as a fascinating study in the evolution of detective and crime fiction, offering a panoptic view of a genre in the throes of transformation.\n\nCategories: Fiction	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0_81PQB_-Gw/hqdefault.jpg	2025-05-11 14:05:54.34137+00	2328
