r of Famous Amos Chocolate Chip Cookies and author of "The Cookie Never Crumbles" “This book is a jewel! Buy lots of copies for your friends and clients.” —Dottie Walters, CSP, Founder of Walters International Speakers Bureau\n\nCategories: Self-Help	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ih_EogKVP6g/hqdefault.jpg	2025-05-18 02:38:43.298518+00	232
